.TH GITHUB-COPILOT-INSTALLER 1 "September 2026" "github-copilot-installer 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
github-copilot-installer \- install GitHub's official GitHub Copilot RPM on Fedora
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B github-copilot-installer
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B github-copilot-installer
retrieves release metadata from GitHub, downloads the official GitHub Copilot
RPM, verifies its published SHA-256 digest and package identity, and delegates
installation or updates to DNF.
.PP
The GitHub Copilot application is proprietary and is not contained in the
installer package or its COPR repository.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install
Install the latest selected GitHub Copilot release.
.TP
.B update
Update an existing recognized GitHub Copilot installation.
.TP
.B prepare
Download and verify a stable release without root or package mutation.
Print schema-version-1 JSON with version, name, arch, sha256, path and source.
Retain the artifact in a private directory for the caller to inspect and remove.
.TP
.B apply
Install a prepared RPM without network access. Requires root, the exact expected
SHA-256 and version. Copies into private privileged staging, then rechecks
identity and digests before invoking DNF. Refuses downgrades. Requires the
installed RPM SHA-256 header to match the artifact after DNF; a different
same-version installed header is refused before DNF can silently skip it.
.TP
.B status
Show the helper and installed application versions, without network access
or temporary files.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove the upstream application package while retaining user data.
.TP
.B version
Print the helper version.
.TP
.B help
Print command usage.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-app\-version " VERSION"
Select an explicit GitHub Copilot release instead of the latest release.
Selects the release for install, update and prepare; required with apply.
.TP
.BR \-\-assumeyes ", " \-y
Pass automatic yes confirmation to DNF. Valid only for mutating commands.
.TP
.BI \-\-directory " DIR"
Existing destination directory for prepare. It creates a private child directory.
.TP
.BI \-\-rpm " FILE"
Regular prepared RPM file for apply. Symlinks are refused.
.TP
.BI \-\-sha256 " HEX"
Expected lowercase SHA-256 digest for apply.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.copilot
Upstream application data. This helper never removes or modifies it.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
sudo github-copilot-installer install
github-copilot-installer status
sudo github-copilot-installer update --assumeyes
sudo github-copilot-installer uninstall
.fi
.SH SECURITY
The upstream RPM is unsigned. Installation therefore requires the SHA-256
digest published by the official GitHub release API and an exact official
release URL. Redirects are restricted to HTTPS on the official GitHub API,
repository release path and GitHub release asset host. Only published stable
releases and epoch-zero recognized Copilot packages are accepted.
.PP
The install transaction disables local-package signature checking for the single
verified Copilot RPM. Repository signature checking and persistent DNF settings
are unchanged. This is a Copilot-specific unsigned-artifact exception, not
publisher-signature verification. Preparation JSON is information for the caller,
not authorization to install; the caller must obtain approval before apply.
